hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"131","\Allah’s Messenger said (Allah bless him and give him peace):‘As for me"," I do not eat while leaning on a support!’”"""
"132","\Allah’s Messenger said (Allah bless him and give him peace): 'I do not eat while leaning on a support! I do not eat while leaning on a support'!”"""
